# Whitelist: track text, ignore binaries, workspace state and plugin code
/*
!/*/
!*.md
!*.base
!*.canvas
!*.css
!*.json
!*.py
!.gitignore
.obsidian/workspace*.json
.obsidian/plugins/*/main.js
.obsidian/plugins/*/styles.css
.obsidian/plugins/obsidian-local-rest-api/
.smart-env/
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.docx
*.xlsx
